     "eyebrow": "Outline to draft",
     "headline": "Draft section by section, in context.",
     "body": "Ask Clarity to write one section at a time. It reads the outline and the paragraphs around it, so each draft fits the piece instead of starting from scratch.",
     "points": [
      {
       "title": "Ask Clarity, inline",
       "text": "Write an instruction right where the paragraph should go."
      },
      {
       "title": "Draft one section at a time",
